      ],
      "source": "https://www.govisitsandiego.com/things-to-do/history/history-of-gaslamp-quarter/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "After World War II, the suburbs expanded while the Gaslamp Quarter became known for tattoo parlors, seedy bars, pawn shops, and locker clubs.",
